{"title":"Career Roadmap · Geography Teacher","role":"Geography Teacher","summary":"A Geography Teacher teaches physical geography, human geography, environmental systems, mapping, resources, climate, population, settlements, and regional development. A modern Geography Teacher increasingly combines pedagogy + GIS + data visualisation + fieldwork + environmental education + digital learning.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Geography & Environmental Planning"},"about":[{"label":"Qualification note","text":"In India, the exact school-teaching eligibility depends on the school level, institution, state, and recruitment rules. A BA alone may not be sufficient for all formal school-teaching posts; the appropriate teacher-education qualification and current eligibility requirements should be verified for the target post."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Timeline","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Geography + communication + teaching fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Applied Geography"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"GIS + fieldwork + environmental studies"}],[{"text":"Teaching Preparation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Pedagogy + lesson design + assessment"}],[{"text":"Qualification"},{"text":"3–4 years"},{"text":"Appropriate teacher-education pathway"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Geography Teacher"}],[{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"3–7 years"},{"text":"Senior Teacher / Subject Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"7–12 years"},{"text":"HoD / Academic Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"12–20 years"},{"text":"Vice Principal / Principal"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"20+ years"},{"text":"Academic Leadership / Education Specialist"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Geography Foundation"},{"type":"p",